(footprint "FCQFN-32_5x5mm_P0.5mm_DA9090"
	(version 20260206)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "DA9090 PMIC (Raspberry Pi 4 rev 1.5), Renesas 32-FCQFN 5.0x5.0 mm, 0.5 mm pitch (package FQ0032AA / PSC-5139-01). No public DA9090 datasheet: its underside matches the DA9080 package (DA9080 datasheet R16DS0519EJ0340 rev 3.4, package outline drawing and recommended land pattern). Plain pads from that land pattern (0.25 x 0.55, toe-to-toe 5.30, heel-to-heel 4.20); irregular pads (10-18, 26-30) and the 1.90 x 0.85 offset centre pad traced from a photo of a DA9090 underside, mirrored to top view and extended 0.15 mm past the package edge like the plain pads.")
	(tags "DA9090 DA9080 FCQFN QFN-32 PMIC Renesas Dialog")
